Conflicts: flatpak-manager-gui
Replaces: flatpak-manager-gui
Description: graphical installer for Flatpak references and AppImage files
 pkg-manager-gui opens a .flatpakref or .AppImage file, asks whether it
 should be installed (or removed, when it is already installed) and shows
 the progress in a Qt 6 window.
 .
 Flatpak applications are installed with the flatpak command. AppImage
 files are copied to /opt/appimages-installed by a helper that runs as
 root through pkexec, with a menu entry, an icon and a record in the dpkg
 database so that they can be removed later.
 .
 This package replaces flatpak-manager-gui.
